  "prefLabel": "He-C 6429.06 Care and Custody Requests",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6429.06 Care and Custody Requests. Following the surrender of the child, anyone requesting care and custody of the child shall contact the family division of the circuit court that has jurisdiction over the matter, pursuant to RSA 169-C.\n\nSource. #8139, eff 8-17-04; ss by #10170, eff 8-17-12; ss by #13412, eff 7-26-22; ss by #13412, eff 7-26-22; ss by #14175, INTERIM, eff 1-18-25, EXPIRES: 7-17-25",
